
[TestNoProtected/invalid-0 - 1]
Diagnostic 1: protectedMember (1:11 - 1:30)
Message: `protected` is not allowed.
Help: Use a `#` prefix instead. A protected member is shared state between a class and everything that ever extends it.
   1 | class A { protected value = 1; }
     |           ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
